      "id": "cezire-i-ibn-2018omer",
      "end": 1599,
      "contributors": [],
      "provenance": "Pleiades",
      "associationCertaintyURI": "https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/association-certainty/certain",
      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p><span>On the borders of the province of\u00a0</span><em>Cez</em><span><em>\u012bre</em>:\u00a0</span><span>The land of\u00a0</span><em>K\u00fcrdist\u0101n\u00a0</em><span>between<em>\u00a0Dicle\u00a0</em></span><span>(Tigris) and\u00a0</span><em>Fur\u0101t\u00a0</em><span>(</span><span>Euphrates</span><span>)</span><span class=\"Yjhzub\" data-processed=\"true\">\u00a0is called\u00a0Cez\u012bre.\u00a0Its western boundary extends southward along the\u00a0<em>Fur\u0101t</em>\u00a0(Euphrates) to the frontier of\u00a0<em>Mal\u0101\u1e6diyye</em>\u00a0(Malatya), then to\u00a0<em>Sams\u0101\u1e6d\u00a0</em>(Samosata), and to\u00a0</span><em>\u1e32</em><span class=\"Yjhzub\" data-processed=\"true\"><em>al\u02bfat\u00fc\u2019r-R\u016bm</em>.\u00a0</span><span class=\"Yjhzub\" data-processed=\"true\">From there, it passes on the side of\u00a0<em>M\u00fcnbic</em>\u00a0(Manbij), then to\u00a0<em>B\u0101l\u012bs</em>,\u00a0</span><em>Ra\u1e33\u1e33a</em><span class=\"Yjhzub\" data-processed=\"true\">\u00a0(Raqqa),\u00a0<em>\u1e32ar\u0121\u0101m\u0131\u015f</em>\u00a0(Carchemish),\u00a0<em>Ra\u1e25be</em>,\u00a0<em>H\u012bt</em>, and ends at\u00a0<em>Enb\u0101r</em>.\u00a0</span><span class=\"Yjhzub\" data-processed=\"true\">From\u00a0<em>Enb\u0101r</em>, it continues along the\u00a0<em>Dicle</em>\u00a0(Tigris) to Tikr\u012bt (Tikrit), then to\u00a0<em>Sin</em>,\u00a0</span><span>\u1e24ad\u012bs\u0320e</span><span class=\"Yjhzub\" data-processed=\"true\">, Mev\u1e63il (Mosul), and from there, to\u00a0<em>Cez\u012bre-i Ibn \u02bf\u00d6mer</em>\u00a0(Cizre) and reaches the city of\u00a0<em>\u0100mid</em>\u00a0(Diyarbak\u0131r)... (partially translated by the first creator of this entry.)</span></p>",
